& [PacketSemantics]
  + status operator_authority_packet_shape_verified_all_candidate_material_untrusted_and_unadmitted authority authority_packet_shape_only
  + every coordinate disposition candidate_shape_admitted_external_verification_required
  + all nine unresolved authorities remain exact
  + candidate_material_authenticated policy_governance_proved key_custody_proved revocation_truth_proved current_nonexpired live_authorization_admitted fresh_observation_proved private_execution_permit_present production_broker_projection_present physical_preparation_authorized and ready_for_physical_execution are false
  + maximum attempts one retry zero cleanup zero and every effect is zero

& [StrictForms]
  + canonical compact UTF-8 JSON denies unknown and duplicate properties
  + maximum form bytes 1048576 depth 24 fields 512 descriptors 9 text bytes 8192
  + UUIDs are nonnil lowercase and digests lowercase sixty-four hex
  + ordered arrays are exact duplicate-free and self-digests domain-separated self-excluding SHA256

& [IndependentVerification]
  + compiler CLI accepts one bounded request regular nonlink file and emits one packet plus newline
  + evidence CLI accepts one exact retained evidence directory and emits one summary plus newline
  + verifier reads only exact request packet verification and manifest files checks membership hashes strict forms and independently recompiles twice
  + adversaries redigest lineage coordinate kind verifier dependency origin fixture confidentiality reference bound declared bytes aggregate authority disposition effect and self-digest mutations

& [ImplementationBoundary]
  + after valid satisfaction signature safe Rust may implement request descriptor packet verification evidence modules two bounded CLIs one integration contract fixture evidence adversaries focused script and documentation
  + production may parse validate hash serialize compile and independently verify metadata only
  + no candidate reference resolution filesystem metadata lookup signer key clock environment process network Git writer provider model MCP broker observation permit or activation surface
  + no new dependency provider download remote fallback WSL D-drive runtime cleanup FPGA Minecraft or foreign work

